  "body": "This is the measurement that #3336 needs. The maintainer reported in chat on 2026-11-22: \"the stock simulation is extremly slow. This was supposed to be calculated on the GPU as a shader, it doesnt seem to be the case\". No reading of the playback cost is recorded today (see the findings comment on #3336).\n\n## Necessary work\nAdd `#[ignore]`d bench tests (heavy lane) that print the readings. They do not assert a wall time. Change no product code.\n\nCases:\n- The fig8 2D Offset (`testdata/models/fig8.step`).\n- One 3D Pocket fixture that the tests use.\n\nReadings, in debug and in release:\n- The lattice cells and the cell size.\n- The number of moves.\n- The time for each cut chunk (`FieldPlay::seek`) and for each move.\n- The time for each lattice pack (`pack_cut`, `pack_cut_patch`).\n- The share of each part in a playing frame.\n\nPost the readings as a table in a comment on #3336, with the CPU and the commit.\n\n## Not in this issue\nThe speed fix. It is the chain #2620, #2627, #2629.\n\nRefs #3336\n",
